    "body": "{\"answer\":\"The Ask POLY browser path works as follows:\\n\\n1. Open the POLY PMNA website at [www.poly-pmna.com](http://www.poly-pmna.com).\\n2. Click on the **Home** link at the top of the page.\\n3. From the **Home** page, you can navigate to the following areas:\\n   * **About**: Learn more about POLY PMNA.\\n   * **Revision 2021**: Access resources for Revision 2021.\\n   * **Revision 2026**: Access resources for Revision 2026.\\n   * **Mock Exams**: Practice with sample question papers.\\n   * **Ask POLY AI**: Interact with me, your educational assistant.\\n   * **2015 Materials**: Explore older-scheme resources.\\n   * **Student Tools**: Find helpful tools and resources.\\n   * **Help**: Get assistance with website issues.\\n\\nYou can also use the **Search** bar at the top of the page to find specific resources or topics.\\n\\nTo access specific resources, you can use the following links:\\n   * [Revision 2021](https://poly-pmna.com/revision-2021)\\n   * [Revision 2026](https://poly-pmna.com/revision-2026)\\n   * [Mock Exams](https://poly-pmna.com/mock-exams)\\n   * [2015 Materials](https://poly-pmna.com/2015-materials)\\n   * [Student Tools](https://poly-pmna.com/student-tools)\\n   * [Help](https://poly-pmna.com/help)\\n\\nIf you need help with a specific page or resource, please let me know and I'll do my best to assist you.\",\"citations\":[],\"usedWeb\":false,\"provider\":\"cloudflare-workers-ai-rest\",\"model\":\"@cf/meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct-fp8-fast\",\"responseId\":\"chatcmpl-06bedf3f-40b0-43ce-8470-d7a0e55a0a4f\",\"knowledgeMode\":\"whole-site-revision-aware-v1\"}",
